    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneers & Valuers proudly offers for sale this charming 2 bedroom mid-terrace property situated in a hugely convenient and popular residential area in the south side of Cork City Center.  \r\n\r\nThe Property comes to the market in excellent condition throughout having been very well cared for and maintained by its current owners. It has a generous footprint with a nice welcoming entrance hall, living room open planned to the dining lounge area with a galley kitchen and bathroom with easy access out on to a spacious rear yard that is nicely enclosed and offers excellent privacy.\r\nUpstairs has two generous bedrooms with a wc facility.\r\n\r\nThe property is perfectly positioned adjacent to all amenities and services available on Evergreen road/ Turners Cross with just minutes walk to Cork City Centre. It has easy access to a regular public bus service available and also has easy access onto the south link road network linking east to west.\r\n\r\nViewing of this lovely property in a prime location comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 3.22m x 0.98m \r\nComposite front door, centre light, tile floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.27m x 2.85m \r\nWooden floor, open fireplace with granite surround, window blind, curtain pole, centre spotlights, open plan to dining/lounge.\r\n\r\nDining/Lounge - 3.32m x 4.25m \r\nSolid wooden floor, open fireplace with cast iron surround, staircase to first floor, under stair storage, open plan to living room. Sliding door to rear yard.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.84m x 2.22m \r\nSolid wooden floor, extensive fitted units, tile splashback, extractor unit, glazed door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.12m x 2.78m \r\nBath unit with overhead electric shower and enclosure, heated towel rail, fully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB with tile surround and wall mirror, centre globe light.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.8m x 3.23m \r\nWooden floor, centre light, window blind.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.16m x 3.22m \r\nWooden floor, velux window with blackout blind, centre light.\r\n\r\nWC - 2.22m x 1.17m \r\nVinyl floor, WC, WHB, wall mirror, centre globe light.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & composite front door \r\nSpacious enclosed rear yard \r\nExcellent condition throughout\r\nReady for immediate occupation  \r\nEasy access to regular public bus service \r\n5 minute walk to Cork City Centre \r\nEasy access to South Link Road Network"
      },
